---
<aside class="author-bio">
  <img
    src="/images/fernando-lisboa.png"
    alt="Fernando Lisboa"
    class="author-photo"
    width="72"
    height="72"
    loading="lazy"
  />
  <div class="author-body">
    <p class="author-name">Fernando Lisboa</p>
    <p>
      I'm an independent Systems Analyst and Tech Writer from Brazil with a
      passion for AI and Robotics.
    </p>
    <p>
      I built TechOnPlay to cut through the noise of the AI world. While big
      media chases headlines, I focus on utility — testing tools, writing
      guides, and making AI accessible for developers, from curious
      beginners to seasoned engineers.
    </p>
    <p>
      Running this independent publishing ecosystem is my full-time
      mission. If this research helped you today, consider supporting my
      work.
    </p>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .author-bio {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding: 28px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ink-deep), var(--violet-deep));
    color: #ece7fb;
  }

  .author-photo {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .author-name {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .author-body p:not(.author-name) {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(236, 231, 251, 0.85);
  }

  .author-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .author-bio {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .author-body p:not(.author-name) {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
